ent-ActionProperKungFuWolfDance = Wolf Dance
    .desc = Dash fast straight through a target up to 5 tiles away without bumping into it, stopping about a tile past it and staying on your feet. The target takes 20 Blunt to the body and is tossed into the air on the spot, landing knocked down (2 s stun). A held shield blocks the hit but gets knocked out of the hands. Right after a Claw Series it becomes a flying kick that hits much harder and sends the target further, but only knocks them down; right after a Claw Whirlwind a faster flying kick sends the target 5 tiles; in both you land on the floor after it. If the target already had at least 85 damage, the plain dash turns into a finisher: 10 more fast dashes through the locked target, each turned 90 degrees (5 Blunt to the body and a toss each), then a final strike for 30 Slash to the head, torso, arms and legs that throws the target 7 tiles. Any Wolf Dance hit marks the target for the Hammer for 2 seconds.
ent-ActionProperKungFuClawWhirlwind = Claw Whirlwind
    .desc = Throw a target within fist reach over yourself and meet their jaw with your knee (10 Blunt to the torso, broken skull, brain trauma). They slowly spin up into the air and crash down. The target can't move for about 2 seconds. Shields don't help. If the target already had at least 80 damage, a huge ascending and then descending claw slash (90 Slash to the torso each) hits them in the air and slams them into the floor (knocked down 4 seconds). A Wolf Dance within 2 seconds becomes a single fast dash that sends the target 5 tiles away, but you fall too. Right after a Wolf Grip it becomes a two-handed cross strike instead of the throw.
ent-ActionProperKungFuHammer = Hammer
    .desc = One sweeping downward claw strike into the head of a target within fist reach (15 Blunt, eyes and brain lose 30 percent). The target is floored and can't get up for 5 seconds. A target in critical condition also gets its skull broken, the head stays on. Right after a Wolf Grip it deals 20 Blunt to the head and you backflip away, and a Wolf Dance within 2 seconds becomes an instant dash into the target. Within 2 seconds after a Wolf Dance hit it deals 20 Blunt to the body and sends the target exactly 5 tiles away. A target that was already lying takes 50 Blunt to the head and falls asleep for 30 seconds.
ent-ActionProperKungFuWolfInstinct = Wolf Instinct
    .desc = For 3 seconds you take a counter stance. Every melee attack on you is parried and answered with a two-palm strike into the attacker's chest (25 Slash, 75 stamina damage); they fly back 3 tiles but stay on their feet. If a gun hurts you, you dash at the shooter up to 8 tiles and, if you reach them, knock them down, knock the gun out of their hands and take them into a hard grab without hurting them; a shooter further away is missed. Thrown objects don't hurt you and fly back at the thrower twice as fast.
